<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Warrior Type</b>

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:33.770
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Fenrir Sword  
Aurvandil's Arrow</b>

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:28.190
Valkyrimon.

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:30.660
His attack freezes opponents with a

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:34.060
cursed absolute zero sword: Fenrir Sword.

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:37.100
That cursed sword always has the <i>edge</i>!

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:39.570
Wow, that was lame...

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:43.510
Taiki and Yuu are facing off, one on one!

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:44.610
This is the end!

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:46.640
All I have to do is defeat Taiki!

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:48.980
For Yuu, for myself...

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:50.850
I'll fight him with all my strength!

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:52.520
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Taiki vs. Yuu,</b>

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>the Boy Generals Face Off!!</b>

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
